---
title: Online shop — catalogue cache miss
---
%% Evidence: illustrative interaction; no measured timings.
%% Render: mermaid-arch render request-sequence.mmd -f svg -f png -f html
sequenceDiagram
  actor Shopper
  participant Web as Storefront
  participant API as Catalogue API
  participant Cache as Redis
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Shopper->>Web: Open product
  Web->>API: GET /products/42
  API->>Cache: GET product:42
  alt Cache hit
    Cache-->>API: Product
  else Cache miss
    Cache-->>API: Not found
    API->>DB: Read product
    DB-->>API: Product
    API->>Cache: SET product:42 (TTL)
    Cache-->>API: Stored
  end
  API-->>Web: Product JSON
  Web-->>Shopper: Product page
